<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia talks with Algeria on gas supply contract.</title>
<headline>Tunisia talks with Algeria on gas supply contract.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia Industry Minister on Thursday said his country was negotiating with Algeria a long term gas supply contract.</p>
<p>Slaheddine Bouguerra, who was talking at the parliament, said the contract in discussion was for 25 years, but didn't disclose the volume his country was asking for.</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
